From 8bdf0c8a798a0f3ff6554302ca1d271accc1b997 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: qiyinxi <qiyinxi@foxmail.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 17:33:46 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 77/95] MAS local: close the lean window at once and shut down
 behind it

Closing the window (title-bar close, Alt+F4, the taskbar's Close window)
now hides the emulator windows right away; Android keeps shutting down in
the background and the process exits on its own, or after the bounded sync
and forced exit. Nothing shows the windows again during that time.

With the windows gone there is nothing left to click, so drop the
force-close question: a repeated close request during the shutdown is
ignored.

Change-Id: I93005213ad2080df55beceaadb50c6162c6b877a
